            ['start_time' => 1344.68, 'end_time' => 1346.28, 'target_text' => 'We\'ll be there. We\'ll give you.', 'source_text' => 'Pasti Allah akan mengurniakan apa yang dijanjikan.', 'order' => 362],
            ['start_time' => 1346.28, 'end_time' => 1351.76, 'target_text' => 'So you know one of the issues of gratitude to show thankfulness to Allah. Yes, it is also to say', 'source_text' => 'Salah satu asas terpenting dalam bersyukur kepada Allah, selain daripada melafazkan ucapan terima kasih,', 'order' => 363],
            ['start_time' => 1351.76, 'end_time' => 1357.84, 'target_text' => 'O Allah. Thank you. But bigger than that is to try and obey the instructions of the same Allah.', 'source_text' => 'iaitu mengucapkan: Ya Allah, terima kasih kepada-Mu, tetapi yang jauh lebih utama adalah berusaha mentaati segala perintah-Nya.', 'order' => 364],
            ['start_time' => 1357.84, 'end_time' => 1362.72, 'target_text' => 'I mean, how will I show gratitude to Allah? Like people say, you want Allah to accept you to', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah kita dapat membuktikan kesyukuran kita yang sebenar kepada Allah? Sebagaimana yang sering diperingatkan:', 'order' => 365],
            ['start_time' => 1362.72, 'end_time' => 1366.72, 'target_text' => 'Allah, but you are eating Haram, you are drinking Haram, you are going Haram, you are doing everything', 'source_text' => 'Anda ingin Allah memakbulkan doa anda, tetapi makanan anda daripada sumber haram, minuman anda haram, pakaian anda haram,', 'order' => 366],
            ['start_time' => 1366.72, 'end_time' => 1370.88, 'target_text' => 'Haram, you\'re not even interested in putting up on you. And here you want to ask Allah. So there\'s', 'source_text' => 'kehidupan anda dipenuhi perkara haram, dan anda tidak berminat mematuhi syariat-Nya, namun anda tetap menuntut doa dimakbulkan.', 'order' => 367],
            ['start_time' => 1370.88, 'end_time' => 1376.56, 'target_text' => 'Hadith, we said that there might be a person in desperate need raising his hands to Allah,', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat hadis Rasulullah ﷺ menceritakan perihal seorang lelaki yang bermusafir jauh dan menadah tangan memohon doa,', 'order' => 368],
            ['start_time' => 1376.56, 'end_time' => 1379.64, 'target_text' => 'but his clothing is haram, his drinking is haram.', 'source_text' => 'namun pakaiannya haram, makanannya haram, dan minumannya daripada sumber yang haram.', 'order' => 369],
            ['start_time' => 1379.64, 'end_time' => 1381.24, 'target_text' => 'How will Allah answer that?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah mungkin doanya akan dimakbulkan oleh Allah?', 'order' => 370],
            ['start_time' => 1381.24, 'end_time' => 1386.16, 'target_text' => 'You know, still Allah from his mercy, he gives us when we don\'t deserve it.', 'source_text' => 'Namun begitu, dengan limpah rahmat-Nya, Allah kadangkala tetap memberi walaupun kita tidak layak menerimanya.', 'order' => 371],
            ['start_time' => 1386.16, 'end_time' => 1392.16, 'target_text' => 'But one of the key ways of showing gratitude to Allah is to align your life according', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jalan utama untuk menzahirkan kesyukuran hakiki kepada Allah adalah dengan menyelaraskan kehidupan anda', 'order' => 372],
            ['start_time' => 1392.16, 'end_time' => 1393.16, 'target_text' => 'to what Allah wants.', 'source_text' => 'selari dengan apa yang diredai oleh Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala.', 'order' => 373],
            ['start_time' => 1393.16, 'end_time' => 1397.96, 'target_text' => 'As a human, we will make mistakes, we commit sins, but we keep on repenting and we try and', 'source_text' => 'Sebagai manusia biasa, kita pasti melakukan kesilapan dan dosa, namun kita hendaklah sentiasa bertaubat', 'order' => 374],
            ['start_time' => 1397.96, 'end_time' => 1400.32, 'target_text' => 'try again and try again and try and so on.', 'source_text' => 'dan terus berusaha memperbetulkan diri berulang-ulang kali.', 'order' => 375],
            ['start_time' => 1400.32, 'end_time' => 1404.2, 'target_text' => 'One of them, or another man, who was talking about the famous Aion,', 'source_text' => 'Seorang alim ulama pernah mengupas ayat suci yang amat masyhur,', 'order' => 376],
            ['start_time' => 1404.2, 'end_time' => 1407.76, 'target_text' => 'sort of Raffet, or Khala, or Bukumuduruni, Estegi Beadokum.', 'source_text' => 'iaitu daripada Surah Ghafir di mana Allah berfirman: Wa qala Rabbukumud\'uni astajib lakum.', 'order' => 377],
            ['start_time' => 1407.76, 'end_time' => 1410.76, 'target_text' => 'And he said, he says,', 'source_text' => 'Dan Tuhanmu berfirman:', 'order' => 378],
            ['start_time' => 1410.76, 'end_time' => 1415.08, 'target_text' => 'and he says, quote, upon me, I shall respond to you.', 'source_text' => 'Berdoalah kepada-Ku, nescaya Aku perkenankan permohonanmu.', 'order' => 379],
            ['start_time' => 1415.08, 'end_time' => 1416.72, 'target_text' => 'And he was speaking about how Allah gives.', 'source_text' => 'Dan beliau menghuraikan bagaimana Allah mengurniakan pemberian kepada hamba-Nya.', 'order' => 380],
            ['start_time' => 1416.72, 'end_time' => 1419.32, 'target_text' => 'He says, Allah gives me me in two ways.', 'source_text' => 'Beliau menjelaskan bahawa pemberian Allah itu terbahagi kepada dua jalan utama.', 'order' => 381],
            ['start_time' => 1419.32, 'end_time' => 1421.76, 'target_text' => 'One way is when you ask, that\'s called Dua.', 'source_text' => 'Jalan pertama adalah apabila anda meminta, itulah yang dinamakan Doa.', 'order' => 382],
            ['start_time' => 1421.76, 'end_time' => 1424.8, 'target_text' => 'Another way is when you don\'t ask, that is called Niram.', 'source_text' => 'Manakala jalan kedua adalah pemberian yang Allah limpahkan sebelum anda meminta pun, itulah yang dinamakan Ni\'mat.', 'order' => 383],
            ['start_time' => 1424.8, 'end_time' => 1425.6, 'target_text' => 'It\'s panellal.', 'source_text' => 'SubhanAllah, Maha Suci Allah yang Maha Mengasihani.', 'order' => 384],
            ['start_time' => 1425.6, 'end_time' => 1427.52, 'target_text' => 'Niram, he gives, like, the shift is mentioned now.', 'source_text' => 'Nikmat kurniaan Allah itu dicurahkan sebagaimana yang diterangkan oleh para alim ulama.', 'order' => 385],
            ['start_time' => 1427.52, 'end_time' => 1429.0, 'target_text' => 'He gives, even if you don\'t ask, he gives.', 'source_text' => 'Allah tetap memberi kepada hamba-Nya walaupun hamba itu tidak meminta.', 'order' => 386],
            ['start_time' => 1429.0, 'end_time' => 1434.0, 'target_text' => 'He goes to the barriers, mainly too as well.', 'source_text' => 'Seterusnya, beliau membincangkan tentang hijab dan penghalang utama doa.', 'order' => 387],
            ['start_time' => 1434.0, 'end_time' => 1436.0, 'target_text' => 'One of them is a village in the area.', 'source_text' => 'Salah satu penghalang terbesar adalah sikap sombong dan takbur (al-Istikbar).', 'order' => 388],
            ['start_time' => 1436.0, 'end_time' => 1438.0, 'target_text' => 'In the Medinnae, it\'s stuck in the road and I\'m glad that he is.', 'source_text' => 'Seseorang yang berasa dirinya serba cukup dan tidak memerlukan Allah,', 'order' => 389],
            ['start_time' => 1438.0, 'end_time' => 1440.0, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t want to go to a lots of panoas.', 'source_text' => 'dia enggan menundukkan diri memohon kepada Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala.', 'order' => 390],
            ['start_time' => 1440.0, 'end_time' => 1441.0, 'target_text' => 'It\'s a barrier.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah penghalang yang amat merbahaya.', 'order' => 391],
            ['start_time' => 1441.0, 'end_time' => 1442.0, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a barrier.', 'source_text' => 'Sikap sombong itu adalah hijab besar antara hamba dengan Tuhannya.', 'order' => 392],
            ['start_time' => 1442.0, 'end_time' => 1444.0, 'target_text' => 'A lots of panoas are very upset in such people.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala murka terhadap orang-orang yang bersikap sombong sedemikian.', 'order' => 393],
            ['start_time' => 1444.0, 'end_time' => 1448.0, 'target_text' => 'And it could end for a bad way, like the air ends in that way.', 'source_text' => 'Akibatnya boleh membawa kepada kesudahan yang buruk di akhirat kelak.', 'order' => 394],
            ['start_time' => 1448.0, 'end_time' => 1450.0, 'target_text' => 'So you can hold it on the head and the medacity.', 'source_text' => 'Sikap sombong menghalang seseorang daripada mendapat rahmat dan keampunan.', 'order' => 395],
            ['start_time' => 1450.0, 'end_time' => 1454.0, 'target_text' => 'And another way, which is also very common, is not arrogance, but ignorance.', 'source_text' => 'Dan satu lagi penghalang yang sangat biasa berlaku bukanlah kesombongan, tetapi kealpaan dan kejahilan (al-Ghaflah).', 'order' => 396],
            ['start_time' => 1454.0, 'end_time' => 1458.0, 'target_text' => 'The panoas, they don\'t go to Allah because they are so used to networking', 'source_text' => 'Sebahagian manusia tidak berdoa kepada Allah kerana mereka terlalu biasa bergantung kepada manusia di sekeliling mereka,', 'order' => 397],
            ['start_time' => 1458.0, 'end_time' => 1463.32, 'target_text' => 'the ground and the earth and with human beings and going to them and turning to them.', 'source_text' => 'mereka terlalu bergantung kepada jaringan hubungan sesama makhluk dan mengharapkan bantuan manusia semata-mata.', 'order' => 398],
            ['start_time' => 1463.32, 'end_time' => 1466.12, 'target_text' => 'Sometimes it comes, sometimes it doesn\'t come, heedlessness.', 'source_text' => 'Kadangkala pertolongan manusia itu sampai, dan kadangkala mengecewakan, itulah akibat kelalaian hati.', 'order' => 399],
            ['start_time' => 1466.12, 'end_time' => 1470.64, 'target_text' => 'So they don\'t go and raise it to the sky because they keep going down to the people.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tidak mengangkat tangan berdoa ke langit kerana mereka terlalu asyik bergantung kepada sesama manusia di bumi.', 'order' => 400],
            ['start_time' => 1470.64, 'end_time' => 1472.76, 'target_text' => 'You know, I\'m going to tell you something crazy.', 'source_text' => 'Tahukah anda, saya ingin berkongsi satu perkara yang amat mengejutkan.', 'order' => 401],
            ['start_time' => 1472.76, 'end_time' => 1477.48, 'target_text' => 'There was a person, a relatively wealthy person who came to me once and told me that,', 'source_text' => 'Pernah suatu ketika, seorang lelaki yang agak berada datang menemui saya lalu berkata:', 'order' => 402],
            ['start_time' => 1477.48, 'end_time' => 1480.92, 'target_text' => 'I give charity, but I don\'t give for Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Saya sentiasa menderma dan bersedekah, tetapi saya menderma bukan kerana Allah.', 'order' => 403],
            ['start_time' => 1480.92, 'end_time' => 1482.24, 'target_text' => 'I say, what do you mean?', 'source_text' => 'Saya bertanya kepadanya: Apakah yang anda maksudkan dengan kata-kata itu?', 'order' => 404],
            ['start_time' => 1482.24, 'end_time' => 1484.32, 'target_text' => 'I mean, I just want to give for me.', 'source_text' => 'Dia menjawab: Maksud saya, saya menderma hanyalah untuk kepuasan diri saya sendiri.', 'order' => 405],
            ['start_time' => 1484.32, 'end_time' => 1490.64, 'target_text' => 'You sound confused because I\'m not trying to impress Allah or something.', 'source_text' => 'Dia berasa keliru sambil berkata: Saya bukan berniat ingin menarik perhatian Allah atau sebagainya.', 'order' => 406],
            ['start_time' => 1490.64, 'end_time' => 1496.0, 'target_text' => 'I just want to give, I just want to give because me as a human being, I\'m a humanitarian.', 'source_text' => 'Saya hanya ingin memberi kerana atas dasar saya sebagai manusia yang berjiwa kemanusiaan (humanitarian).', 'order' => 407],
            ['start_time' => 1496.0, 'end_time' => 1499.24, 'target_text' => 'So I think that this is arrogance and it\'sistic bar.', 'source_text' => 'Saya menegaskan bahawa ini adalah satu bentuk keegoan yang amat halus dan kesombongan (al-Istikbar).', 'order' => 408],
            ['start_time' => 1499.24, 'end_time' => 1503.72, 'target_text' => 'What happens is that person removes Allah from the equation so Allah does not allow them', 'source_text' => 'Apa yang berlaku ialah apabila seseorang menyingkirkan Allah daripada persamaan hidupnya, maka Allah tidak mengizinkan dia', 'order' => 409],
            ['start_time' => 1503.72, 'end_time' => 1505.68, 'target_text' => 'to worship him the way he wants.', 'source_text' => 'untuk beribadah kepada-Nya dengan cara yang diredai-Nya.', 'order' => 410],
            ['start_time' => 1505.68, 'end_time' => 1510.56, 'target_text' => 'I promise you because we\'ve seen it that when someone removes Allah and they think it\'s', 'source_text' => 'Saya berani menjamin bahawa apabila seseorang menyingkirkan Allah dan menganggap segalanya adalah hasil usahanya sendiri,', 'order' => 411],
            ['start_time' => 1510.56, 'end_time' => 1511.56, 'target_text' => 'like Arun.', 'source_text' => 'dia sudah bersikap seperti Qarun.', 'order' => 412],
            ['start_time' => 1511.56, 'end_time' => 1518.56, 'target_text' => 'Sarhana said, this is all mine. So that means if he did anything good, he doesn\'t relate that goodness to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Qarun pernah berkata dengan sombong: Semua kekayaan ini adalah milikku dan hasil kepandaianku sendiri. Dia tidak menyandarkan kebaikan itu kepada Allah.', 'order' => 413],
            ['start_time' => 1518.56, 'end_time' => 1526.56, 'target_text' => 'If he helped someone and gave someone some charity, he didn\'t do it for Allah because he doesn\'t believe that what came to him was from Allah in the first place.', 'source_text' => 'Jika dia membantu seseorang dan memberi sedekah, dia tidak melakukannya kerana Allah kerana dia tidak meyakini bahawa rezeki itu datang daripada Allah sejak awal lagi.', 'order' => 414],
            ['start_time' => 1526.56, 'end_time' => 1528.56, 'target_text' => 'It came to me from my brain.', 'source_text' => 'Dia beranggapan: Kekayaan ini datang daripada hasil kebijaksanaan otakku sendiri.', 'order' => 415],
            ['start_time' => 1528.56, 'end_time' => 1538.06, 'target_text' => 'So you need to understand your existence, your heartbeat, your breathing, your eyesight, your hearing, your smelling, your senses.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu anda wajib sedar bahawa kewujudan anda, degupan jantung anda, pernafasan anda, penglihatan, pendengaran, dan deria rasa anda,', 'order' => 416],
            ['start_time' => 1538.06, 'end_time' => 1542.86, 'target_text' => 'Everything is only and solely from the maker Allah.', 'source_text' => 'segala-galanya adalah semata-mata kurniaan daripada Pencipta anda, iaitu Allah SWT.', 'order' => 417],
            ['start_time' => 1542.86, 'end_time' => 1546.26, 'target_text' => 'And so your whole existence is owed to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan seluruh kehidupan serta kewujudan anda adalah berhutang budi sepenuhnya kepada Allah.', 'order' => 418],
            ['start_time' => 1546.26, 'end_time' => 1549.26, 'target_text' => 'That\'s why Brahim Ali, He\'s Salaam, Krenulah Salati.', 'source_text' => 'Itulah intipati tauhid yang diikrarkan oleh Nabi Ibrahim \'Alaihissalam: Inna salati,', 'order' => 419],
            ['start_time' => 1549.26, 'end_time' => 1553.06, 'target_text' => 'And that\'s connected to Arafah as well, to Hajj in the Salati.', 'source_text' => 'dan perkara ini berkait rapat dengan intipati Arafah dan ibadah haji,', 'order' => 420],
            ['start_time' => 1553.06, 'end_time' => 1554.98, 'target_text' => 'In the Salati, when Ushuki, when Mahiaya, when Mahiaya,', 'source_text' => 'iaitu: Inna salati wa nusuki wa mahyaya wa mamati,', 'order' => 421],
            ['start_time' => 1554.98, 'end_time' => 1556.34, 'target_text' => 'when Mahiaya, when Mahiaya, when Mahiaya, when Mahiaya,', 'source_text' => 'sesungguhnya solatku, ibadah korbanku, kehidupanku, dan kematianku,', 'order' => 422],
            ['start_time' => 1556.34, 'end_time' => 1564.66, 'target_text' => 'that my prayer, right, my sacrifice, my life, my death, all of that,', 'source_text' => 'bahawa sesungguhnya solatku, pengorbananku, hidupku, dan matiku, kesemuanya itu,', 'order' => 423],
            ['start_time' => 1564.66, 'end_time' => 1565.66, 'target_text' => 'belongs to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'hanyalah milik mutlak Allah SWT.', 'order' => 424],
            ['start_time' => 1565.66, 'end_time' => 1566.66, 'target_text' => 'It\'s from Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Semuanya datang daripada kurniaan Allah.', 'order' => 425],
            ['start_time' => 1566.66, 'end_time' => 1567.66, 'target_text' => 'Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Allahu Akbar, Maha Suci Allah.', 'order' => 426],
            ['start_time' => 1567.66, 'end_time' => 1568.9, 'target_text' => 'It\'s from Allah Subhanahu wa ta\'ala.', 'source_text' => 'Segala-galanya adalah daripada Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala semata-mata.', 'order' => 427],
            ['start_time' => 1568.9, 'end_time' => 1570.46, 'target_text' => 'So we have to always relate to it.', 'source_text' => 'Maka kita wajib sentiasa menyandarkan segala nikmat kepada-Nya.', 'order' => 428],
            ['start_time' => 1570.46, 'end_time' => 1572.98, 'target_text' => 'When you do something, do it for the sake of Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda melakukan sesuatu amal kebajikan, ikhlaskanlah semata-mata kerana Allah.', 'order' => 429],
            ['start_time' => 1572.98, 'end_time' => 1574.46, 'target_text' => 'Allah, you gave me.', 'source_text' => 'Katakanlah: Ya Allah, Engkau yang telah mengurniakan rezeki ini kepadaku,', 'order' => 430],
            ['start_time' => 1574.46, 'end_time' => 1575.46, 'target_text' => 'I\'m giving.', 'source_text' => 'maka aku menyumbangkannya kembali demi mencari keredaan-Mu.', 'order' => 431],
            ['start_time' => 1575.46, 'end_time' => 1576.66, 'target_text' => 'Allah, you helped me.', 'source_text' => 'Ya Allah, Engkau telah banyak membantuku,', 'order' => 432],
            ['start_time' => 1576.66, 'end_time' => 1578.66, 'target_text' => 'I\'m helping.', 'source_text' => 'maka kini aku membantu hamba-Mu yang lain.', 'order' => 433],
            ['start_time' => 1578.66, 'end_time' => 1582.3, 'target_text' => 'And in that way, you will be able to achieve something great, kind of love of your', 'source_text' => 'Dan dengan keikhlasan itu, anda akan mencapai ganjaran yang teramat agung di sisi-Nya.', 'order' => 434],
            ['start_time' => 1582.3, 'end_time' => 1583.3, 'target_text' => 'own al-Abhadi.', 'source_text' => 'Sebagaimana sabda Baginda Nabi ﷺ dalam hadis yang masyhur:', 'order' => 435],
            ['start_time' => 1583.3, 'end_time' => 1584.3, 'target_text' => 'Al-Abhadi.', 'source_text' => 'Wallahu fi \'awnil-\'abd,', 'order' => 436],
            ['start_time' => 1584.3, 'end_time' => 1588.74, 'target_text' => 'Al-Abhadi, Allah will continue to give you and to help you for as long as you are helping', 'source_text' => 'Allah sentiasa menolong hamba-Nya selagi mana hamba itu bersedia menolong', 'order' => 437],
            ['start_time' => 1588.74, 'end_time' => 1590.94, 'target_text' => 'someone else on a totally different level.', 'source_text' => 'saudaranya yang lain, pertolongan yang melangkaui batas pemikiran manusia.', 'order' => 438],
            ['start_time' => 1590.94, 'end_time' => 1594.26, 'target_text' => 'So getting back to out of an age.', 'source_text' => 'Maka berbalik kita kepada perbincangan mengenai hari Arafah dan ibadah haji.', 'order' => 439],
            ['start_time' => 1594.26, 'end_time' => 1598.26, 'target_text' => 'I just want to just second what you mentioned before, for the viewers,', 'source_text' => 'Saya ingin menegaskan semula pesanan yang tuan sebutkan tadi kepada para penonton sekalian,', 'order' => 440],
            ['start_time' => 1598.26, 'end_time' => 1603.76, 'target_text' => 'is that if you want your dura to be accepted all the time, make sure that you eat hala.', 'source_text' => 'iaitu jika anda ingin doa anda sentiasa dimakbulkan oleh Allah, pastikan makanan anda daripada sumber yang halal.', 'order' => 441],
            ['start_time' => 1603.76, 'end_time' => 1605.52, 'target_text' => 'Not hala meat, but eat hala.', 'source_text' => 'Bukan sekadar daging yang halal, tetapi seluruh sumber rezeki anda mestilah benar-benar halal.', 'order' => 442],
            ['start_time' => 1605.52, 'end_time' => 1607.16, 'target_text' => 'Eating hala.', 'source_text' => 'Menjaga sumber makanan agar sentiasa halal dan bersih.', 'order' => 443],
            ['start_time' => 1607.16, 'end_time' => 1612.56, 'target_text' => 'In the sound hadi, the first organ that will rot in your body when you go to the grave is your stomach.', 'source_text' => 'Di dalam hadis yang sahih dinyatakan bahawa anggota tubuh pertama yang akan hancur mereput di dalam kubur adalah perut anda.', 'order' => 444],
            ['start_time' => 1612.56, 'end_time' => 1614.26, 'target_text' => 'So, make sure that you eat hala.', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, pastikan apa yang masuk ke dalam tubuh anda adalah rezeki yang halal.', 'order' => 445],
            ['start_time' => 1614.26, 'end_time' => 1615.26, 'target_text' => 'Ithala.', 'source_text' => 'Bertaqwalah kepada Allah dalam mencari nafkah.', 'order' => 446],
            ['start_time' => 1615.26, 'end_time' => 1616.26, 'target_text' => 'That\'s correct.', 'source_text' => 'Tepat sekali, itulah kunci kebersihan rohani.', 'order' => 447],
            ['start_time' => 1616.26, 'end_time' => 1619.76, 'target_text' => 'And in the sound hadi, sadar dura le mama was given advice.', 'source_text' => 'Dan dalam hadis yang sahih, pesanan agung telah diberikan kepada sahabat mulia Sa\'d ibn Abi Waqqas radiallahu \'anhu.', 'order' => 448],
            ['start_time' => 1619.76, 'end_time' => 1624.76, 'target_text' => 'But sad was no one to be a person who doesn\'t accept his derand.', 'source_text' => 'Sa\'d dikenali sebagai seorang sahabat yang doanya sentiasa makbul tanpa hijab.', 'order' => 449],
